# Provision N2/N3 analogously, with separate credentials. Never reuse them in UI.
user node_N1
 topic write chamgap/v4/Z1/N1/telemetry
 topic write chamgap/v4/Z1/N1/status
 topic write chamgap/v4/Z1/N1/ack
 topic write chamgap/v4/Z1/N1/result
 topic read chamgap/v4/Z1/N1/cmd
user readonly_collector
 topic read chamgap/v4/+/+/telemetry
 topic read chamgap/v4/+/+/status
 topic read chamgap/v4/+/+/ack
 topic read chamgap/v4/+/+/result
user supervised_executor
 topic write chamgap/v4/+/+/cmd
 topic read chamgap/v4/+/+/status
 topic read chamgap/v4/+/+/ack
 topic read chamgap/v4/+/+/result
